# The Next Chapter
#
# A score for a short film about inheritance and foresight. D major at 66,
# six scenes of four bars (the last one held): a music box alone (a story
# you were born with), the felt piano's tune over a bed (passed down), a
# turn to the minor with a borrowed G minor and a heartbeat under it (the
# chapters that end too soon), a rising line at dawn with the choir coming
# in (seeing further), the full statement (what may lie ahead), and a
# ritardando into D add9 with the music box answering (a chapter of your
# own).

bpm 66
gate 0.92
tail 5

section BORN     0..16
section PASSED   16..32
section LOSS     32..48
section DAWN     48..64
section AHEAD    64..80
section YOURS    80..96

automate bpm
66 R:84 54:12@smooth

automate reverb_decay
0.78
automate reverb_wet
0.36 R:32 0.42:16@smooth R:16 0.46:16@smooth R:16
automate chorus_mode
2
automate chorus_depth
0.22
automate spring
0.08
automate tape_wow
0.10
automate tape_flutter
0.04
automate tape_drive
0.12
automate tape_age
0.15
automate lfo_rate
0.22
automate lfo_shape
0.5
automate lfo_pitch
2.5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- the bed
