[43 55 59 62 67]@0.48 [45 57 61 64 69]@0.5 [42 54 57 61 66]@0.48 [47 54 59 62 66]@0.46
[43 55 59 62 67]@0.42 [45 57 62 64]:2@0.4 [45 57 61 64]:2@0.38 [38 50 57 62 64 66]:8@0.36

automate pad.gain
0.0 0.85:8@smooth R:88

